TI  - Simulated weightlessness induces hippocampal insulin resistance and cognitive impairment.
AU  - Li, Jiahui
AU  - Xue, Caiyan
AU  - Yang, Hongyan
AU  - Zhang, Jiaxin
AU  - Li, Guohua
AU  - Li, Jijun
AU  - Kuang, Fang
