TI  - Brain connectivity and behavioral changes in a spaceflight analog environment with elevated CO(2).
AU  - McGregor, Heather R.
AU  - Lee, Jessica K.
AU  - Mulder, Edwin R.
AU  - De Dios, Yiri E.
AU  - Beltran, Nichole E.
