TI  - SLC25A mitochondrial carriers as biomarkers and therapeutic targets of spaceflight-induced dysfunction: the ADP/ATP carrier (AAC3) as a structural case  study.
AU  - D'Addabbo, Pietro
AU  - De Grassi, Anna
AU  - De Luca, Danila Imperia
AU  - Scaglione, Valeria
AU  - Francavilla, Anna Lucia
AU  - Todisco, Sabino
