TI  - Cellular changes in an in vitro neural circuit system under simulated microgravity.
AU  - Ryu, Dahee
AU  - Kim, Dohyung
AU  - Shim, Yoonhee
AU  - Jin, Geonho
AU  - Mun, Seonghun
AU  - Kim, Jinsik
AU  - Yoon, Hyeon-Seung
