TI  - The Effects of Long Duration Spaceflight on Sensorimotor Control and Cognition.
AU  - Tays, Grant D.
AU  - Hupfeld, Kathleen E.
AU  - McGregor, Heather R.
AU  - Salazar, Ana Paula
AU  - De Dios, Yiri Eleana
