TI  - Liquid chromatography-mass spectrometry-based urinary metabolomics study on a rat model of simulated microgravity-induced depression.
AU  - Xu, Teng
AU  - Lu, Cong
AU  - Feng, Li
AU  - Fan, Lin-Xi
