TI  - Lower body negative pressure as a research tool and countermeasure for the physiological effects of spaceflight: A comprehensive review.
AU  - Paladugu, Phani
AU  - Ong, Joshua
AU  - Kumar, Rahul
AU  - Waisberg, Ethan
AU  - Zaman, Nasif
AU  - Kamran, Sharif Amit
AU  - Tavakkoli, Alireza
AU  - Rivolta, Maria Chiara
AU  - Nelson, Nicolas
