TI  - Nrf2 plays a critical role in the metabolic response during and after spaceflight.
AU  - Uruno, Akira
AU  - Saigusa, Daisuke
AU  - Suzuki, Takafumi
AU  - Yumoto, Akane
AU  - Nakamura, Tomohiro
