TI  - Space-like (56)Fe irradiation manifests mild, early sex-specific behavioral and neuropathological changes in wildtype and Alzheimer's-like transgenic mice.
AU  - Liu, Bin
AU  - Hinshaw, Robert G.
AU  - Le, Kevin X.
