TI  - Effect of simulated microgravity via head-down tilt on intracranial compliance, brain oscillations and cardiovascular autonomic modulation.
AU  - Mendes Zambetta, Rafaella
AU  - De Favari Signini, Étore
AU  - Catai, Aparecida Maria
AU  - Benelli, Alberto
AU  - Angius, Luca
