TI  - Activation of HIF-1α and its downstream targets in rat hippocampus after long-term simulated microgravity exposure.
AU  - Wang, Tingmei
AU  - Chen, Hailong
AU  - Lv, Ke
AU  - Ji, Guohua
AU  - Liang, Fengji
AU  - Zhang, Yongliang
AU  - Wang, Yanli
