TI  - Spirulina platensis components mitigate bone density loss induced by simulated microgravity: A mechanistic insight.
AU  - Zhang, Jian
AU  - Huang, Yaxin
AU  - Bai, Ning
AU  - Sun, Yuying
AU  - Li, Ke
AU  - Ruan, Huan
AU  - Yan, Bowen
AU  - Hu, Jian
