TI  - Treatment with a superoxide dismutase mimetic for joint preservation during 35 and 75 days in orbit aboard the international space station, and after 120 days  recovery on Earth.
AU  - Patel, Chirayu M.
AU  - Wiele, Sabrina Vander
AU  - Kim, Leslie
