TI  - Automated MRI-based quantification of posterior ocular globe flattening and recovery after long-duration spaceflight.
AU  - Sater, Stuart H.
AU  - Sass, Austin M.
AU  - Rohr, Jesse J.
AU  - Marshall-Goebel, Karina
AU  - Ploutz-Snyder, Robert J.
AU  - Ethier, C. Ross
AU  - Stenger, Michael B.
