TI  - Gravitational stress during parabolic flights reduces the number of circulating innate and adaptive leukocyte subsets in human blood.
AU  - Stervbo, Ulrik
AU  - Roch, Toralf
AU  - Kornprobst, Tina
AU  - Sawitzki, Birgit
AU  - Grütz, Gerald
AU  - Wilhelm, Andreas
