TI  - SETY©: A next-generation robotic training platform for safe and autonomous surgery in space - surgical biomechatronics design and Hardware-Software  integration within the SY-MIS project.
AU  - Cornejo, Jose
AU  - Oscco, Bernabé
AU  - Gamarra-Vásquez, Luis
AU  - Mayorga, Jose
AU  - Tejada-Marroquin, Gabriel
AU  - Cuyotupac, Victor
