TI  - Morphological and Molecular Changes in Juvenile Normal Human Fibroblasts Exposed to Simulated Microgravity.
AU  - Buken, Christoph
AU  - Sahana, Jayashree
AU  - Corydon, Thomas J.
AU  - Melnik, Daniela
