TI  - Characterization of the mechanical behavior of the optic nerve sheath and its role in spaceflight-induced ophthalmic changes.
AU  - Raykin, Julia
AU  - Forte, Taylor E.
AU  - Wang, Roy
AU  - Feola, Andrew
AU  - Samuels, Brian C.
AU  - Myers, Jerry G.
AU  - Mulugeta, Lealem
AU  - Nelson, Emily S.
