TI  - Altered cerebral perfusion in response to chronic mild hypercapnia and head-down tilt Bed rest as an analog for Spaceflight.
AU  - Roberts, Donna R.
AU  - Collins, Heather R.
AU  - Lee, Jessica K.
AU  - Taylor, James A.
AU  - Turner, Matthew
AU  - Zaharchuk, Greg
AU  - Wintermark, Max
AU  - Antonucci, Michael U.
