TI  - Managing Select Medical Emergencies During Long-Duration Space Missions.
AU  - Tran, Kim-Anh
AU  - Pollock, Neal W.
AU  - Dion, Pierre-Marc
AU  - Lapierre, Marjorie
AU  - Tremblay, Sophie
AU  - Witteman, William
