TI  - Space-associated stem cell hallmarks of aging and resilience in astronauts.
AU  - Pham, Jessica
AU  - Nandi, Shuvro P.
AU  - Balaian, Larisa
AU  - Engstrom, Claire
AU  - Chang, Patrick
AU  - Mack, Karla
