TI  - Mapping and identification of a reverse mutation of Rht2 that enhances plant height and thousand grain weight in an elite wheat mutant induced by spaceflight.
AU  - Chen, Xin
AU  - Xiong, Hongchun
AU  - Guo, Huijun
AU  - Chen, Shihua
AU  - Zhao, Linshu
