TI  - Early changes to the extracellular space in the hippocampus under simulated microgravity conditions.
AU  - Gao, Yajuan
AU  - Han, Hongbin
AU  - Du, Jichen
AU  - He, Qingyuan
AU  - Jia, Yanxing
AU  - Yan, Junhao
