TI  - Zebrafish selection strategy for the first zebrafish cultivation experiment on the Chinese space station.
AU  - Jia, Chaoxian
AU  - Zhang, Xianyuan
AU  - Sun, Haoyuan
AU  - Gu, Peifan
AU  - Yuan, Yongchun
AU  - Gao, Wenting
