TI  - Relationship of collagen as the component of the extracellular matrix with the mechanisms of autonomic regulation of the cardiovascular system under simulated  conditions of long-term isolation.
AU  - Rusanov, V. B.
AU  - Pastushkova, L. Kh
AU  - Chernikova, A. G.
AU  - Kashirina, D. N.
