TI  - Long-term hindlimb unloading causes a preferential reduction of medullary thymic epithelial cells expressing autoimmune regulator (Aire).
AU  - Horie, Kenta
AU  - Kudo, Takashi
AU  - Yoshinaga, Riko
AU  - Akiyama, Nobuko
AU  - Sasanuma, Hiroki
