TI  - Human cranial bone-derived mesenchymal stem cells cultured under simulated microgravity can improve cerebral infarction in rats.
AU  - Kuwabara, Masashi
AU  - Mitsuhara, Takafumi
AU  - Teranishi, Masataka
AU  - Okazaki, Takahito
AU  - Takeda, Masaaki
AU  - Ishii, Daizo
