TI  - Fresh Gastrodia elata Blume alleviates simulated weightlessness-induced cognitive impairment by regulating inflammatory and apoptosis-related pathways.
AU  - Zhang, Yiwen
AU  - Huang, Hong
AU  - Yao, Caihong
AU  - Sun, Xinran
