TI  - Regulation of the cerebrovascular smooth muscle cell phenotype by mitochondrial oxidative injury and endoplasmic reticulum stress in simulated microgravity rats  via the PERK-eIF2α-ATF4-CHOP pathway.
AU  - Zhang, Ran
AU  - Jiang, Min
AU  - Zhang, Jibin
AU  - Qiu, Ya
AU  - Li, Danyang
AU  - Li, Sulei
AU  - Liu, Junsong
AU  - Liu, Chuanbin
