TY  - JOUR
TI  - Plantar Mechanical Stimulation Maintains Slow Myosin Expression in Disused Rat Soleus Muscle via NO-Dependent Signaling.
AU  - Sharlo, Kristina A.
AU  - Paramonova, Inna I.
AU  - Lvova, Irina D.
AU  - Mochalova, Ekaterina P.
AU  - Kalashnikov, Vitaliy E.
