TI  - Adoptive Transfer of Lepr(+) Bone Marrow Cells Attenuates the Osteopetrotic Phenotype of db/db Mice.
AU  - Turner, Russell T.
AU  - Wong, Carmen P.
AU  - Philbrick, Kenneth A.
