TI  - Neutralizing mitochondrial ROS does not rescue muscle atrophy induced by hindlimb unloading in female mice.
AU  - Eshima, Hiroaki
AU  - Siripoksup, Piyarat
AU  - Mahmassani, Ziad S.
AU  - Johnson, Jordan M.
AU  - Ferrara, Patrick J.
