TI  - Roles of Irisin in the Linkage from Muscle to Bone During Mechanical Unloading in Mice.
AU  - Kawao, Naoyuki
AU  - Moritake, Akihiro
AU  - Tatsumi, Kohei
AU  - Kaji, Hiroshi
