TI  - Dietary astaxanthin supplementation attenuates disuse-induced muscle atrophy and myonuclear apoptosis in the rat soleus muscle.
AU  - Yoshihara, Toshinori
AU  - Yamamoto, Yuki
AU  - Shibaguchi, Tsubasa
