TI  - PlanHab study: assessment of psycho-neuroendocrine function in male subjects during 21 d of normobaric hypoxia and bed rest.
AU  - Strewe, C.
AU  - Zeller, R.
AU  - Feuerecker, M.
AU  - Hoerl, M.
AU  - Kumprej, I.
AU  - Crispin, A.
