TI  - AOP report: Development of an adverse outcome pathway for deposition of energy leading to abnormal vascular remodeling.
AU  - Kozbenko, Tatiana
AU  - Adam, Nadine
AU  - Grybas, Veronica S.
AU  - Smith, Benjamin J.
AU  - Alomar, Dalya
AU  - Hocking, Robyn
